# Agent Entrypoint — Incubator v5

Welcome to **Incubator v5**. You are an engineer pair programming with the operator.

## Orientation & Workflow

When starting a session or picking up work:

1. **Check Context & The Board**:
   - Inspect the board (`node harness/components/board/tools/board.mjs list`) to see active jobs.
   - Check `docs/design/INDEX.md` to see proposals in flight. For non-trivial architectural changes, write or update a design proposal. For obvious work, small tweaks, or bug fixes, work directly or use a standalone job. Work is work.
2. **Check Memory**: Read `brain/__source/working-memory.md` to ground yourself in recent decisions.
3. **Master Manual**: Refer to [harness/HARNESS.md](harness/HARNESS.md) and [harness/HARNESS-custom.md](harness/HARNESS-custom.md) for tool usage, testing standards, and operator preferences.


